WEBVTT

00:09:56.133 --> 00:10:01.972
So in the future, we will likely have
treatments for many terrible diseases,

00:10:01.972 --> 00:10:04.099
including cystic fibrosis,

00:10:04.141 --> 00:10:05.768
muscular dystrophy

00:10:05.768 --> 00:10:07.227
and sickle cell anemia.

00:10:07.978 --> 00:10:11.148
These diseases are caused
by mutated proteins,

00:10:11.148 --> 00:10:14.568
and we can use mRNA to ask our cells

00:10:14.568 --> 00:10:18.030
to make the correct version
of these proteins.

00:10:18.072 --> 00:10:23.327
We'll have treatments for cancer --
breast, blood, lungs -- you name it.

00:10:23.786 --> 00:10:28.499
Here, we'll use mRNA
to teach our immune cells

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:31.418
how to find and kill cancer cells.